{25}{[He looks crestfallen.] Bum deal! You don't say. Poor lad. HA! I'll miss that bumbling sapling. He was a bit of alright. But jolly good! You'll be wanting a receipt for that penny-pinching shopkeeper. Ha! The biggest oozing sore in the bum to deal with. Ha ha!}{[He looks crestfallen.] Bum deal! You don't say. Poor lad. HA! I'll miss that bumbling sapling. He was a bit of alright. But jolly good! You'll be wanting a receipt for that penny-pinching shopkeeper. Ha! The biggest oozing sore in the bum to deal with. Ha ha!}{}{}{}{qu 1191 3, gf3014 1, in -32850, in 32851, lf1 1}
