{30}{[He eyes you suspiciously, but sighs reluctantly.] Still, you did brave through enough of those hairy buggers to bring me my damn supplies. Ha! Knowing that shopkeeper, you'll be needing a receipt or you'll be pulling gold from his nose! HA! Here ya go. I just hope that sapling's still hopping in his skivvies. Ha ha!}{[He eyes you suspiciously, but sighs reluctantly.] Still, you did brave through enough of those hairy buggers to bring me my damn supplies. Ha! Knowing that shopkeeper, you'll be needing a receipt or you'll be pulling gold from his nose! HA! Here ya go. I just hope that sapling's still hopping in his skivvies. Ha ha!}{}{}{}{qu 1191 3, gf3014 1, in -32850, in 32851, lf1 1}
