{45}{Oh! Smashing that you asked, old chap! I was here to get the legendary Flaming Emeralds of Miasmire, and so that's just what I was going to do!  Unfortunately, like a complete idiot I'd forgotten my spare ammunition and all I had was an old rusted sword! I realized that was bloody useless after the first swing, so I tossed it aside.  With just my bare fists and a bit of luck, I negotiated my way to this final Miasmirian outpost. Hah!}{Oh! Smashing that you asked, madame! I was here to get the legendary Flaming Emeralds of Miasmire, and so that's just what I was going to do!  Unfortunately, like a complete idiot I'd forgotten my spare ammunition and all I had was an old rusted sword! I realized that was bloody useless after the first swing, so I tossed it aside.  With just my bare fists and a bit of luck, I negotiated my way to this final Miasmirian outpost. Hah!}{}{}{}{}
