{160}{Dispose of them? My dear lady! If you think I dispatched those overgrown babboons all by my lonesome, you've been terribly mistaken! You see, as I readied myself for some fisticuffs with these uninvited guests, I noticed a wooden projectile flit right past my head and into the throat of one of my attackers as he fell dead to the ground! THUD!! And just like that, the fates of the other two were quickly negotiated as well! HA! What a marvelous show that was! HaHAH! Jolly good!}{Dispose of them? My dear lady! If you think I dispatched those overgrown babboons all by my lonesome, you've been terribly mistaken! You see, as I readied myself for some fisticuffs with these uninvited guests, I noticed a wooden projectile flit right past my head and into the throat of one of my attackers as he fell dead to the ground! THUD!! And just like that, the fates of the other two were quickly negotiated as well! HA! What a marvelous show that was! HaHAH! Jolly good!}{}{}{}{}
